      "source_xml_line": 2566,
      "string_id": "commander_second_dialog_phrase_3",
      "occurrence": 1,
      "EN": "Here, as agreed: a million rubles. It's all right by the book:",
      "JA_current": "Here, as agreed: a million rubles. It's all right by the book:",
      "JA_new": "約束どおり、100万ルーブルだ。きっちり全額そろってる。",
